### Warehouse Inventory API: example requests
### Run from IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code (REST Client). Ids assume a fresh database with sample data.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### List items (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items?page=0&size=10&sort=name,asc

### Search items by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/items?name=shirt

### Get one item with its variants
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1

### Create an item with variants
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hoodie",
  "description": "Fleece-lined pullover hoodie",
  "basePrice": 249000,
  "variants": [
    { "sku": "HD-GRY-M", "name": "Grey / M", "initialStock": 10,
      "attributes": { "color": "Grey", "size": "M" } },
    { "sku": "HD-GRY-XL", "name": "Grey / XL", "price": 269000, "initialStock": 4,
      "attributes": { "color": "Grey", "size": "XL" } }
  ]
}

### Update an item
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Canvas Tote Bag", "description": "Heavy canvas tote, now with zip", "basePrice": 79000 }

### Delete an item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/3

### Add a variant
POST {{baseUrl}}/items/4/variants
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "MUG-RED", "name": "Red", "initialStock": 8, "attributes": { "color": "Red" } }

### List the variants of an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1/variants

### Update a variant (price, name, attributes; not stock)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/1/variants/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "TS-BLK-XL", "name": "Black / XL", "price": 115000,
  "attributes": { "color": "Black", "size": "XL" } }

### Delete a variant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/2/variants/7

### Restock a variant
POST {{baseUrl}}/variants/4/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "RESTOCK", "quantity": 30, "reason": "PO-2026-0117" }

### Adjust stock (negative = remove units)
POST {{baseUrl}}/variants/4/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "ADJUSTMENT", "quantity": -2, "reason": "Damaged in storage" }

### Stock history of a variant
GET {{baseUrl}}/variants/4/stock-movements

### Low-stock report
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/low-stock?threshold=3

### Place an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "variantId": 2, "quantity": 2 },
    { "variantId": 9, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "note": "Walk-in customer"
}

### Order the same mug again: its last unit was sold above -> 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "variantId": 9, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=COMPLETED

### Get an order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1

### Cancel an order (stock is returned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel
